{"id":"u_berhaupt","lemma":"überhaupt","pos":"adv","rank":305,"glosses":["overall, in general","even, anyway; used to move from a more specific matter to a more fundamental aspect, often a question","at all; used to move specifically to an existential question"],"ipa":"/ˌyːbɐˈhaʊ̯pt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d6/De-%C3%BCberhaupt.ogg/De-%C3%BCberhaupt.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Wie ist das überhaupt möglich?","en":"How's that even possible?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/761670","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"possible"}]},{"text":"Wie alt bist du überhaupt?","en":"How old are you anyway?","words":[null,null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[0,4,"how old are you"]]},{"text":"Wissen Sie überhaupt, wer das ist?","en":"Do you even know who that is?","words":[{"g":"to know"},{"g":"she / they / you"},null,{"g":"who"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Er ist überhaupt nicht ehrlich.","en":"He is not honest at all.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"honest, truthful, true"}]},{"text":"Ich habe überhaupt keine Freunde.","en":"I have no friends at all.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"friends"}]}]}